  "notes": "Upgrade of a page whose May-2026 revision predated the current spec draft: the event was described as firing on individual form controls after autofill completed, and the spec link pointed at the HTML Standard's general autofill section. Re-derived from the 2026-03-04 WICG Draft CG Report and Blink trunk IDL: fires at the Document before commit, autofillValues + one-shot refill, full-address token. Two implementation divergences disclosed (no constructor in Blink; AutofillFieldData dictionary vs spec tuple). No BCD entry, no MDN page, no webstatus event entry — compat is interim ChromeStatus/runtime data, labelled."
